<h1 data-path-to-node="2">巴金森氏症（PD）藥物治療與策略討論紀錄</h1><h2 data-path-to-node="3">一、 藥物分類與機轉整理 (Pharmacology)</h2><h3 data-path-to-node="4">1. 多巴胺前驅物與複方 (Levodopa &amp; Combinations)</h3><ul data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">短效型：</b> <code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="5">Madopar</code> (Levodopa / Benserazide 250mg)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">長效型：</b> <code data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="5">Numient ER</code> (Levodopa 195 mg ／ Carbidopa 48.75 mg)</p><ul data-path-to-node="5,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0,0"><i data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">效價轉換：</i> Potency 約為一般 Levodopa 的 <b data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="30">0.6 ~ 0.7</b> 倍，換算使用時劑量需乘以 <b data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="53">1.6 倍</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,1,1,0"><i data-path-to-node="5,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">重要警訊：</i> 臨床併用時易引發<b data-path-to-node="5,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="14">惡性神經症狀群 (NMS, Neuroleptic Malignant Syndrome)</b>，需特別密切監測。</p></li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="6">2. 多巴胺受體促效劑 (Dopamine Agonists, DA)</h3><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Rotigotine</code> (Neupro patch 經皮吸收貼片，劑型 8 mg/24 hr/pce)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Pramipexole</code> (Mirapex)</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="8">3. 單胺氧化酶抑制劑 (MAO-B Inhibitors)</h3><ul data-path-to-node="9"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Safinamide</code> (Equfina 50mg) QD</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Rasagiline</code> (Rakinson)</p><ul data-path-to-node="9,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,1,0,0"><i data-path-to-node="9,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">臨床限制：</i> 若患者處方中含有 <code data-path-to-node="9,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="15">Madopar</code> 時，Rakinson 劑量<b data-path-to-node="9,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="36">只能使用 0.5 顆 QD</b>。</p></li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="10">4. 其他輔助機轉藥物</h3><ul data-path-to-node="11"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">NDMA 受體拮抗劑 (NDMARi)：</b> <code data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="21">Amantadine</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">COMT 抑制劑 (COMTi)：</b> <code data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="18">Entacapone</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">抗膽鹼藥物 (Anti-Ch)：</b> <code data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="17">Biperiden</code>、<code data-path-to-node="11,2,0" data-index-in-node="27">Trihexyphenidyl</code></p><ul data-path-to-node="11,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,2,1,0,0"><i data-path-to-node="11,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">適應症：</i> 用於治療藥物誘發之錐體外症候群 (Medication-induced EPS)，如異動症 (Dyskinesia)、陣攣 (Clonus)；或巴金森氏症狀本身之剛直 (Rigidity)、顫抖 (Tremors)、痙攣 (Spasms)、僵硬 (Stiffness) 及肌肉控制不佳。</p></li></ul></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="12"><h2 data-path-to-node="13">二、 依年齡層之臨床治療策略 (Treatment Algorithms by Age)</h2><p data-path-to-node="14">治療方針依據患者年齡區分為大於及小於 60 歲兩大系統，隨病程進展之建議加藥順序如下：</p><h3 data-path-to-node="15">1. 高齡患者族群 (Age &gt; 60 歲)</h3><blockquote data-path-to-node="16"><p data-path-to-node="16,0"><b data-path-to-node="16,0" data-index-in-node="0">核心思維：</b> 首選 Levodopa 以快速改善症狀，後續視狀況加上輔助藥物，末期惡化或出現精神症狀時考慮精神科藥物。</p></blockquote><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2555635432="" class="ng-tns-c2555635432-21 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2555635432="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2555635432-21 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-code